Licensing
=========

This repository is OfficeKit: a workspace and portable plugin for branded
documents, slide decks, and narrated video.

AGPL-3.0-or-later — Strudel / Dough music bed
---------------------------------------------

The optional video music-bed renderer at

    plugins/office-kit/skills/strudel-offline/

is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or
later (AGPL-3.0-or-later). That tree vendors Dough and depends on AGPL
npm packages published by uzu/strudel:

    @strudel/core
    @strudel/mini
    @strudel/tonal
    @strudel/transpiler
    supradough

Using that skill — including evaluating Strudel patterns and writing WAV
files with Dough — is subject to AGPL-3.0-or-later. The complete license
text is in plugins/office-kit/skills/strudel-offline/LICENSE.

Upstream: https://codeberg.org/uzu/strudel

This notice discloses that component. It does not relicense the rest of
OfficeKit as AGPL. Combining this repository with that skill in a product
may still trigger AGPL obligations for the combined work; read the AGPL
and get counsel if you ship a closed-source service that includes the
renderer.
